{"t":"HUM","made":"2026-11-11 00:34","name":"Humana Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Healthcare Plans","employees":67060,"hq":"Louisville, KY, United States","website":"https://www.humana.com","summary_en":"Humana Inc. provides medical and specialty insurance products in the United States. It operates in two segments, Insurance and CenterWell. The Insurance segment offers individual Medicare Advantage products, including health insurance benefits, including wellness programs, chronic care management, and care coordination; individual Medicare stand-alone prescription drug products (PDP); group Medicare advantage and Medicare stand-alone PDP; Medicare supplements; specialty and ancillary insurance comprising dental, vision, life and disability; and administrative services to arrange health care services for active-duty and retired military personnel and dependents, as well as pharmacy benefit managers. Its CenterWell segment operates full-service, value-based senior focused primary care centers under the Conviva Senior Primary Care and CenterWell Senior Primary Care brands; a management services organization; CenterWell Home Health, a home health provider; and OneHome, which manages post-acute patient needs, as well as provides pharmacy and hospice solutions. The company was formerly known as Extendicare Inc. and changed its name to Humana Inc. in April 1974. Humana Inc. was founded in 1961 and is headquartered in Louisville, Kentucky.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Humana Inc.는 미국에서 의료 및 전문 보험 상품을 제공합니다. Insurance와 CenterWell의 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 보험 부문은 웰니스 프로그램, 만성질환 관리, 진료 조정을 포함한 건강 보험 혜택을 포함한 개별 Medicare Advantage 제품을 제공합니다. 개별 Medicare 독립형 처방의약품(PDP); 그룹 메디케어 이점 및 메디케어 독립형 PDP; 메디케어 보충제; 치과, 시력, 생명 및 장애로 구성된 전문 및 보조 보험; 현역 및 퇴역 군인 및 부양가족, 약국 혜택 관리자를 위한 의료 서비스를 마련하기 위한 행정 서비스. CenterWell 부문은 Conviva Senior Primary Care 및 CenterWell Senior Primary Care 브랜드로 풀 서비스, 가치 기반 노인 중심 일차 진료 센터를 운영합니다. 관리 서비스 조직; 가정 건강 서비스 제공자인 CenterWell Home Health; 급성 환자의 요구를 관리하고 약국 및 호스피스 솔루션을 제공하는 OneHome도 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Extendicare Inc.로 알려졌으며 1974년 4월에 이름을 Humana Inc.로 변경했습니다. Humana Inc.는 1961년에 설립되었으며 켄터키주 루이빌에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":425.105,"mcap":51056492544.0,"pe":41.47366,"fpe":24.445484,"peg":1.1953,"ps":0.33113787,"pb":2.7121665,"ev_ebitda":12.898,"div":0.84,"beta":0.643,"hi52":456.5,"lo52":163.11},"fin":{"rev":154185007104.0,"rev_g":0.261,"eps_g":-0.179,"gross":0.13012,"op":0.0025,"net":0.00808,"roe":0.06736,"fcf":3292000000.0,"cash":25109000192.0,"debt":13374999552.0,"de":70.812,"eps":10.25,"feps":17.38992},"own":{"short":0.0347,"inst":1.0307,"insider":0.00206},"analyst":{"n":24,"mean":475.54166,"median":495.0,"high":596.0,"low":280.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.96154,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":13,"hold":9,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":13,"hold":9,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":11,"hold":12,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":11,"hold":13,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":526.0,"priorPriceTarget":463.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Guggenheim","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":521.0,"priorPriceTarget":471.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":587.0,"priorPriceTarget":582.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":495.0,"priorPriceTarget":460.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-13","Firm":"Mizuho","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarg